<!--
    Themed-icon layer. The system uses only this drawable's alpha, so it has to be a silhouette:
    the artwork's white fills would read as solid rather than as holes, and the grey road under the
    blue route would flatten into one stripe with it. So this keeps the route, the car and the two
    endpoints, all at the foreground's scale, and cuts the car windows out with evenOdd.

    The endpoints are solid here rather than rings: their hole and the route's stroke are both
    radius 16, so a ring would be plugged by the route and never show. Solid leaves a visible bulb.
-->
